n\u003cp\u003eRelated: \u003ci\u003eTwo pilots dead after plane and ground vehicle collide at LaGuardia\u003c/i\u003e - \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47486386\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47486386\u003c/a\u003e (667 comments)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47503965\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47503965\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 323\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 259\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/mar/24/laguardia-airplane-pilots-safety-concerns-crash","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47503965","date_published":"2026-03-24T15:19:19Z","author":{"name":"m_fayer","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=m_fayer"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47503810","title":"Epic Games to cut more than 1k jobs as Fortnite usage falls","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.epicgames.com/site/en-US/news/todays-layoffs\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://www.epicgames.com/site/en-US/news/todays-layoffs\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47503810\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47503810\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 231\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 383\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://www.reuters.com/legal/litigation/epic-games-said-tuesday-that-it-will-lay-off-more-than-1000-employees-2026-03-24/","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47503810","date_published":"2026-03-24T15:09:30Z","author":{"name":"doughnutstracks","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=doughnutstracks"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47503617","title":"Show HN: Gemini can now natively embed video, so I built sub-second video search","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003eGemini Embedding 2 can project raw video directly into a 768-dimensional vector space alongside text. No transcription, no frame captioning, no intermediate text. A query like \"green car cutting me off\" is directly comparable to a 30-second video clip at the vector level.\u003cp\u003eI used this to build a CLI that indexes hours of footage into ChromaDB, then searches it with natural language and auto-trims the matching clip. Demo video on the GitHub README.\nIndexing costs ~$2.50/hr of footage. Still-frame detection skips idle chunks, so security camera / sentry mode footage is much cheaper.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47503617\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47503617\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 226\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 66\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://github.com/ssrajadh/sentrysearch","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47503617","date_published":"2026-03-24T14:58:27Z","author":{"name":"sohamrj","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=sohamrj"}}]}